            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">While the bearer is within range of an objective marker, weapons equipped by the bearer have the [Sustained Hits 1] ability. (Default enhancement; may be replaced with Wages of Retribution: Each time an Adeptus Astartes model from your army destroys your Oath of Moment target, if the bearer is on the battlefield, roll one D6: on a 4+, you gain 1CP.)</characteristic>
