          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">At the start of the Fight phase, you can select one of the following abilities to apply to models in this unit until the end of the phase: Swords of the Chapter: Each time a model in this unit makes a melee attack, re-roll a Hit roll of 1. Shields of the Chapter: Each time an invulnerable saving throw is made for a model in this unit, re-roll a saving throw of 1.</characteristic>
